ng to get you to do that what's your  that trying to get you out of  your potential comfort zone do you see a  general a consistency amongst the way  defenses are playing you at all that's a  good question i i think all defenses  kind of play us differently and one week  it might be  a lot of single high safety in the next  week it might be a lot of uh too high  safety so uh it's all about game  planning and seeing what team does what  um and prepping for those guys because  you know i think they all do play a  little bit differently which is the  toughest defense you've seen this year  then uh there have been a few you know i  think new england's got a really good  defense they're really well coached and  you know they do a great job of  disguising everything and making one  thing look like another and um you know  they've had a lot of success on defense  okay so the patriots the one that stands  out to you did you see that uh any of  the monday night game justin got to  watch that one and uh it was really a  close game came down to the wire so uh  it's always a lot of fun to watch yeah i  mean you know what  what do you think's going through mac  jones's head as he throws it only twice  in an evening justin what was that love  what is that like i think that's a tough  situation quarterback you know you  always love to throw the ball but you  have to do anything you can to win the  game and um you know they found a way to  win the game by only throwing the ball  three times so a really impressive job  so uh when you go and you went into  cincinnati and it's joe barrow and you  and you're part of the same draft class  do you think at all that uh i want to  beat this guy and just show somebody if  anybody needs anything to be proven  justin any of that sort of pride on the  line last weekend for you you know i  think going into the game you want to  win every game um you know i got to know  joe it's a combine and he's a great guy  and we got to spend some time togeth