gers quarterback here on the rich  eisen show what do you think about  what's going on at your alma mater now  looking for a new coach who uh has left  for uh the university of miami what do  you think about that justin  i think it's always a tough situation  you know coach crystal and i were we  were really close and you know i really  loved playing for him and um you know  you can't fault the guy he he uh he has  a great opportunity to go coach there  back home and be with his mother and  you know i feel for all the guys at  oregon because you know they've they put  so much into it but i trust  administration i know they're gonna find  the right guy okay is there somebody in  in mind is there somebody you would want  to pound the table for justin you do  have a little bit of sway even just  saying something publicly so  what do you have anything i uh i haven't  done enough research yet so if at the  end of the year when football's over and  and they're still looking for a coach  i'll help you hey you'll be part of this  that's to be part of the search okay  yeah all right  and honestly i think you're playing uh  remarkably well not just because of of  who you are and who you represent but i  don't know if you're aware you are the  quarterback of both of my fantasy teams  uh i appreciate that that means the most  to me well you know i i've put a lot of  faith in you uh justin there's no  question about it and right now one of  those teams is 11 and two and uh you and  keenan are on that team together so  um do me a favor mention that to coach  staley and uh and and apologize to mike  williams when you have to you know throw  it to 13. will you mind would you mind  doing that a little bit what do you  think i'll uh i'll get that taken care  of i love it i love it terrific okay i  like it  all right and now you're not touching  your hair this year right this is it  what we're seeing this time that uh that  wasn't the plan for this year so uh  was it in the plan for last year i don't  know if it was in the plan for last year  even no it technically wasn't so i think  that's just something that uh it kind of  came up but okay i'll have to address  that after the year okay very good  that's another after the year addressing  take care of yourself justin herbert  appreciate the time you be well sir  awesome thank you very much right back  at you that's justin herbert los angeles  chargers quarterback right here on the  rich eisen show hey you watched all the  way to the end thanks for that watch  more right here

